  - nodeId: ch_1
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Sobota, si\xF3dma rano. Bus\xE1ras. Autobus do Kielc przez Holyhead i p\xF3\u0142 Europy stoi z w\u0142\u0105czonym silnikiem."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: ch5_saw_tomek_off
    branchNodeId: ch_tomek
    nextNodeId: ch_river
  - nodeId: ch_tomek
    lines:
    - speakerId: tomek
      language: 0
      text: "Kanapki zjem do Holyhead. Piwo w Kielcach. Trzymam za s\u0142owo, Kuba."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: ch_river
  - nodeId: ch_river
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Kuba wraca wzd\u0142u\u017C Liffey. D\u017Awigi stoj\u0105. Nikt ich ju\u017C nie liczy i nikt nimi nie obraca."
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Cztery lata. Zlew, deska, dwie restauracje, jeden krach. I pytanie, kt\xF3re zadaj\u0105 mi tata, mama, Tomek i ta cisza w kuchni: co dalej?"
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: ch4_with_gavin
    branchNodeId: ch_gavin
    nextNodeId: ch_declan
  - nodeId: ch_gavin
    lines:
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Perth, Kooba. Western Australia. Mines, money, and they're crying out for chefs. I fly in November. Come with me.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - mines
    - crying
    - fly
    - november
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: ch_decide
  - nodeId: ch_declan
    lines:
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: Whatever you decide, Kooba, decide it yourself. Not the banks, not the radio. You.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - decide
    - yourself
    - banks
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: ch_decide
  - nodeId: ch_decide
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Heraklit: nie wchodzi si\u0119 dwa razy do tej samej rzeki. Ani do tego samego kraju. Ani do tego samego zlewu."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: "Zostaj\u0119 w Dublinie. Przetrwam to razem z nimi."
      targetNodeId: ch_stay
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: Wracam do Polski.
      targetNodeId: ch_home
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "Lec\u0119 z Gavinem do Australii."
      targetNodeId: ch_perth
      requiredFlag: ch4_with_gavin
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: ch_stay
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Zostaj\u0119. Nie dlatego, \u017Ce tu \u0142atwiej. Dlatego, \u017Ce tu jestem kim\u015B, kogo znaj\u0105 z imienia. Prawie."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch5_stays
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 5
      integration: 10
